TcCLB.508461.430, UniProtKB Q4E4R6). A superposition of the β4 Q4CU77 subunit on the β2 Q4E4R6 subunit shows that the loop containing the F24 and I29 residues of β4 subunit matches the β2 loop in proximity to the predicted β3 binding site (
